    "description": "Free event budget calculator for Sri Lanka. Enter guests, food per head, venue, stage, AV and branding to see your total budget and cost per guest instantly.",
    "h1": "Event Budget Calculator",
    "body": "**Short answer:** this free calculator helps you estimate the total cost of an event in Sri Lanka. Enter your guest count, food cost per head and the main fixed costs, such as venue, stage, sound, lighting and branding. It adds a contingency and shows your total budget and cost per guest. Use your own supplier quotes for the most accurate result.\n\n[[EVENT_BUDGET_CALCULATOR]]\n\n## How to use the calculator\n\n1. **Number of guests.** Enter your expected guest count. If you are unsure, use the higher number.\n2. **Food and beverage per guest (LKR).** Use the per-head price from your venue or caterer. Include tea breaks and drinks.\n3. **Venue hire (LKR).** Enter the hire fee if the venue charges separately from food. Enter 0 if it is included.\n4. **Stage, sound, lighting and LED (LKR).** Use your AV supplier's quote.\n5. **Decor and branding (LKR).** Backdrops, banners, signage, flowers and table items.\n6. **Entertainment and MC (LKR).** DJ, band, dancers, performers and MC.\n7. **Photography and video (LKR).**\n8. **Transport, permits and other (LKR).**\n9. **Planning and management fee (LKR).** The event company's fee, if separate.\n10. **Contingency (%).** We suggest 10%.\n\nThe calculator shows:\n\n- Food total (guests × per-head cost)\n- Fixed costs total\n- Contingency amount\n- **Total estimated budget**\n- **Cost per guest**\n\n## Where to get the numbers\n\nThe calculator is only as accurate as the numbers you enter. The best approach is to ask two or three suppliers for each major item and use the middle quote. If you don't have quotes yet, ask your event planner for a rough range.\n\nFor more help understanding each cost, read our guide to [event planning cost in Sri Lanka](https://advertisingsrilanka.lk/blog/event-planning-cost-sri-lanka). For a professional, itemised budget built around your goals, Cypher Events can prepare one as part of its [event planning Sri Lanka](https://cypherevents.lk/event-planning-sri-lanka) service.\n\n## Why per-guest cost matters\n\nLooking at cost per guest helps you:\n\n- **Compare event formats.** A cocktail evening and a full sit-down dinner can have very different per-guest costs.\n- **Check value.** If the cost per guest feels high, see which fixed costs can be reduced or shared.\n- **Plan future events.** Use the per-guest figure as a benchmark for next year.\n\nFixed costs such as stage and LED don't change much with guest numbers. Food does. That means a larger event often has a lower cost per guest, as long as the venue has room.\n\n## Tips to keep your event within budget\n\n- **Fix the guest count early.** It affects food, seating and venue choice.\n- **Choose the venue carefully.** A hotel package that includes food, basic sound and furniture can be simpler than a bare venue.\n- **Combine AV suppliers.** One supplier for stage, sound, lighting and LED usually costs less than several.\n- **Use reusable branding.** Roll-up banners and generic backdrops can be used again.\n- **Avoid late changes.** Changes in the last two weeks often cost the most.\n- **Keep the contingency.** Unexpected costs always appear, such as extra power, transport or printing.\n\n## Typical items people forget\n\n- Service charge and taxes on food\n- Generator back-up for outdoor venues\n- Set-up and breakdown labour\n- Transport for equipment and crew to outstation venues\n- Staff meals for crew and event staff\n- Permits and security\n- Printing for name badges, menus and table numbers\n- Gifts for speakers and chief guests\n\nAdd these under \"Transport, permits and other\" so your total is realistic.\n\n## Related services\n\nAdvertising Sri Lanka can quote for many of the items in this calculator:\n\n- [Stage setup](https://advertisingsrilanka.lk/stage-setup-sri-lanka)\n- [LED screen rental](https://advertisingsrilanka.lk/led-screen-rental-sri-lanka)\n- [Event branding and printing](https://advertisingsrilanka.lk/event-branding-printing-sri-lanka)\n- [Event catering](https://advertisingsrilanka.lk/event-catering-sri-lanka)\n- [Event photography](https://advertisingsrilanka.lk/event-photography-sri-lanka)\n\n## Example calculation\n\nHere is how the calculator works with simple example numbers (for illustration only, not real prices):\n\n- 200 guests × LKR 5,000 food per guest = LKR 1,000,000 food total\n- Fixed costs (venue, stage and AV, branding, entertainment, photography, other, fee) = LKR 1,500,000\n- Subtotal = LKR 2,500,000\n- 10% contingency = LKR 250,000\n- **Total = LKR 2,750,000**\n- **Cost per guest = LKR 13,750**\n\nIf the guest count rises to 250 and fixed costs stay the same, the cost per guest drops. That is why it pays to confirm numbers early and choose a venue that fits.",
